                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "👍 Length is good and does not overstay its welcome for the amount of content.\n👍 Excellent characters and some of them are very bouncy. Always nice to hear all their banter.\n👍 Compromising the attire of the ladies is so much fun it should probably be illegal 🤣\n👍 Fixed instead of random encounters are always better.\n👍 Good effort with equipment and itemization.\n👍 Very nice character art...\n👎 but I just wish there is more of it.\n👎 More fun scenes with the characters would have been awesome, difficult to say goodbye 😭\n👎 I know it is typical for these kinds of games, but less linear level design would work wonders.\n🤷 It is RPGM, love it or hate it.",
